  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Latin American Laboratory for Assessment of the Quality of Education (2022-2026 cycle) - ERCE 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LLECE was established in November 1994; it works through a network of education quality assessment partners, based in the Ministries of Education of member countries. The network serves as a forum for technical discussions on learning outcomes, associated factors and variables affecting students&apos; performance. Its main objective is to assist authorities from Ministries of Education in making informed decisions on education policies, based on LLECE&apos;s results and research. At the moment, LLECE is a network composed of 19 member countries (all Spanish speaking countries plus Brazil).</narrative>
  </description>
